msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Scrobbles what you watch in Kodi and syncs your library with Trakt"
msgstr "Scrobálann sé a bhféachann tú air in Kodi agus sioncrónaíonn sé do leabharlann le Trakt"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Trakt Relay scrobbles the movies, episodes, live TV and recordings you watch in Kodi to Trakt, and syncs your library with it: collection, watched status, ratings and playback progress, each direction switched on in the settings. It asks for a rating after you watch, and its context menu rates, adds to the watchlist and starts a rewatch of a show. Scrobbles that fail are retried later.[CR][CR]Trakt Relay is a modified version of script.trakt by Trakt.tv, Razzeee and its contributors."
msgstr "Scrobálann Trakt Relay chuig Trakt na scannáin, na heipeasóidí, an teilifís bheo agus na taifeadtaí a bhféachann tú orthu in Kodi, agus sioncrónaíonn sé do leabharlann leis: bailiúchán, stádas féachta, rátálacha agus dul chun cinn athsheinm, gach treo le cumasú sna socruithe. Iarrann sé rátáil tar éis duit féachaint, agus lena roghchlár comhthéacs is féidir rátáil a dhéanamh, cur leis an liosta faire agus athbhreathnú ar sheó a thosú. Déantar iarracht arís níos déanaí ar scrobálacha a theipeann.[CR][CR]Is leagan modhnaithe é Trakt Relay de script.trakt le Trakt.tv, Razzeee agus a rannpháirtithe."

msgctxt "Addon Disclaimer"
msgid "Trakt Relay is not affiliated with or endorsed by Trakt."
msgstr "Níl baint ag Trakt Relay le Trakt agus níl sé formhuinithe ag Trakt."

